# Save As from Go to Command writes the outline to a new file and later edits go there, leaving the opened file as it was.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
END
keys :
type save as
keys <Enter>
see Save As
keys <End> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS>
type copy.taskpaper
keys <Enter>
status copy.taskpaper
keys j x
see ✔ Post office
quit
saved <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
END
